    {
      "id": "objective",
      "heading": "Objective",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "To send a notification (email message) when a user completes registration in an IRS (Infosys Reservation System) application by integrating JMS with Spring Boot using ActiveMQ."
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 26,
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "id": "what-is-jms",
      "heading": "What is JMS?",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Java Message Service (JMS) is an API that allows applications to communicate with one another by sending and receiving messages via a messaging system (message broker) such as ActiveMQ."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Message Producer – sends a message.",
            "Message Consumer – receives the message.",
            "Message Broker – intermediates between producers and consumers."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 49,
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "id": "what-is-activemq",
      "heading": "What is ActiveMQ?",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "ActiveMQ is an open-source, multi-protocol, Java-based messaging server. It supports JMS and is used here as the message broker."
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 19,
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "id": "demo-setup",
      "heading": "Demo Setup",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [],
      "wordCount": 0,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "start-activemq-server",
          "heading": "Start ActiveMQ Server",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ensure the ActiveMQ message broker is running locally (usually at http://localhost:8161)."
            }
          ],
          "wordCount": 11,
          "subsections": []
        },
        {
